  "about": "Price book 3.1 as numbers, and years and months worked by hand from it. src/knos/billing.py (tests/test_billing.py) and web/price.js (tests/web/price.mjs, and the page in tests/web/pricing.mjs) must both give exactly these. Amounts are USD.",
