    {"name": "the worked customer: Business, 110,000 evaluations a month, 10 million accepted a year, none released on chain", "in": {"plan": "business", "evaluations": 110000, "accepted": "10000000.00", "on_chain_percent": 0, "lookups": 0}, "how": "Control 100,000. Meter (110,000 - 100,000) x 0.002 x 12 = 240. Acceptance: 833,333.33 a month is under 1,000,000, so all of it pays 0.30%: 10,000,000 x 0.30% = 30,000. 100,000 + 240 + 30,000 = 130,240. Three times that is 390,720.", "out": {"control": "100,000.00", "meter": "240.00", "acceptance": "30,000.00", "paid_on_chain": "0.00", "rebate": "0.00", "records": "0.00", "total": "130,240.00", "benefit_to_demand": "390,720.00"}},
